The legacy provider was observed running but absent from the HIDL
service registry, leaving camera and torch unavailable until its
process was restarted. Enable the opt-in initialization watchdog.

--- a/vendor.prop
+++ b/vendor.prop
@@ -80,6 +80,9 @@
 persist.vendor.qcom.bluetooth.soc=cherokee
 ro.vendor.bluetooth.wipower=false
 
+# Camera
+vendor.camera.provider24.init_timeout_ms=20000
+
 # CNE
 persist.vendor.cne.feature=1
 
